b_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will it be the enigmatic stranger or the sweet classmate? Love or fear? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make decisions wisely, as every action can profoundly alter Hikari's fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock all 6 (six) endings and experience unforgettable <u>emotions!</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Captivating detective storyline.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First love and romance.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 (six) unique endings.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unbelievable mysteries.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful atmospheric music.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming characters and scenic backgrounds.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes a roadmap to unlock all endings.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unforgettable summer adventure!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game is not suitable for children or those who are easily disturbed.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Another visual novel: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
